    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Presented in pristine condition throughout, this exceptional second-floor apartment at 48 The Cedar, Parkview offers spacious, light-filled accommodation finished to an excellent standard.\r\n\r\nThe property features two generous double bedrooms, including a superb principal bedroom with en-suite bathroom, together with a well-appointed main bathroom. A large open-plan living and dining area provides an ideal space for both relaxing and entertaining, while the modern fitted kitchen is thoughtfully designed with ample storage and workspace. There is a good sized private west facing balcony overlooking the trees and gardens.\r\n\r\nMeticulously maintained by its current owners, the apartment is presented in turnkey condition, allowing purchasers to move in and immediately enjoy all that this sought-after development has to offer. Large windows throughout maximise natural light, enhancing the sense of space and comfort.\r\n\r\nResidents benefit from a peaceful setting, beautifully maintained communal areas, and the convenience of a prime location close to local amenities, transport links, shopping, and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious, stylish, and immaculately presented two-bedroom apartment in one of Parkview's most desirable residential developments."
      },
